916 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 344 0 R
/T (However, there are significant downsides too. The lifestyles portrayed by many celebrities can be extremely extravagant and sometimes promote unhealthy values, such as excessive consumerism or superficial appearances. This can create unrealistic expectations for young fans, leading to disappointment or a focus on material possessions. Furthermore, some celebrities engage in controversial behaviour or scandals that are widely publicised, providing a poor example. Young people, especially, might not always have the maturity to critically assess the information they receive and could be negatively influenced by these aspects.)
/E (However, there are significant downsides too. The lifestyles portrayed by many celebrities can be extremely extravagant and sometimes promote unhealthy values, such as excessive consumerism or superficial appearances. This can create unrealistic expectations for young fans, leading to disappointment or a focus on material possessions. Furthermore, some celebrities engage in controversial behaviour or scandals that are widely publicised, providing a poor example. Young people, especially, might not always have the maturity to critically assess the information they receive and could be negatively influenced by these aspects.)
