/T (1. Crime rate among teenagers - O'smirlar orasidagi jinoyat darajasi 2. Social media and technology - Ijtimoiy tarmoqlar va texnologiya 3. Exposed to violent content - Zo'ravon kontentga duchor bo'lish 4. Aggressive behavior - Zo'ravon harakat 5. Socio-economic factors - Ijtimoiy-iqtisodiy omillar 6. Lack of parental supervision - Ota-onalarning nazorat etishining yo'qligi 7. Breeding ground for crime - Jinoyat uchun sharoit yaratish 8. Struggling families - Qiyin ahvolda bo'lgan oilalar 9. Mental health issues - Ruhiy salomatlik muammolari 10. Comprehensive approach - Keng qamrovli yondashuv)
