/T (However, we can't ignore the importance of practical life skills. Many young adults leave school feeling unprepared for the realities of independent living. Knowing how to budget, manage personal finances, and prepare nutritious meals are essential skills that directly impact daily well- being and future success. I've seen friends struggle with debt because they never learned to budget, and others who rely heavily on convenience food because cooking seemed too daunting.)
